                         "summary":  "The Solari art of absolute stillness. A master of Vault-Breath can slow their heart to silence and vanish from any heat-sense.",
                         "fullEntry":  "In the geothermal depths of the Harath-Vault, body heat is the difference between a useful worker and a corpse. The Solari forged Vault-Breath to close that gap. The discipline trains absolute physical stillness: metabolism slowed, movement reduced to micro-adjustments, breathing synchronized with the volcanic vent cycles until a Solari at rest radiates nothing the cavern can detect.\n\nAt its highest level, Vault-Breath allows a Solari to enter a state of suspended animation indistinguishable from death. No heartbeat. No breath. No heat signature. The Hollow-Solari Sun-Speakers use this state during their sacred meditations. The Waste-Solari rangers employ it for ambush hunting in the cinder badlands, lying flat on black rock for days before the strike.\n\nVault-Breath is not magic. It is discipline hammered into muscle and bone over years of practice. A Solari who has mastered it is the most patient predator in the Sundale badlands, and the most difficult target.\n\nLearn Vault-Breath and the volcanic dark becomes a place you can wait. The vents mark time. The stillness becomes a weapon. The cinder badlands have room for one more ambush.",
